exports[`asBrainAuthApiBilledLine given: [case6] a spawn env with ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set, on a seat with no login when: [t0] the notice is rendered then: it says the seat has no /login to fall back on 1`] = `
"🟡 this clone bills the anthropic api, since ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set
   ├─ claude code ranks ANTHROPIC_API_KEY above a /login and CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN, and this seat has no /login
